xt":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","time":{"start":1790564607073,"end":1790564607092}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_08022439fd4a3400016ab9d8fe7db487d2b88e4443d0869778"}},"id":"prt_0e5f7a21b0019Tgl1K7307ri6P","sessionID":"ses_f1a087aeaffe6drfnH5MZxc2OA","messageID":"msg_0e5f79bd5001Whd3S5u0gmNj70"}}
