{"type":"text","timestamp":1790564616453,"sessionID":"ses_f1a087aeaffe6drfnH5MZxc2OA","part":{"id":"prt_0e5f7c634001xClDbyhuj7bq12","messageID":"msg_0e5f7c060001cndOC7uacdJ04e","sessionID":"ses_f1a087aeaffe6drfnH5MZxc2OA","type":"text","text":"I’ve checked the session requirements against room capacity, traits, availability, and cost. The June 10 update makes Bay Workshop unavailable, so I’m recording the initial assignment and the targeted repair while preserving the unaffected sessions.","time":{"start":1790564615732,"end":1790564616446},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0f4e29a3291e7c31016ab9d9079b8c87d287fdcf7e4bf1a78d","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790564633577,"sessionID":"ses_f1a087aeaffe6drfnH5MZxc2OA","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_0H4Xz3m1NDFw2bY8BmX9B4g4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/answer/initial_room_plan.md\n+# Initial Room Plan — 2026-06-18\n+\n+Based on the planning files available before the June 10 coordinator update. Assignments meet the hard requirements and use the lowest-cost valid room for each session.\n+\n+| Session | Assignment and supporting evidence | Backup considered |\n+|---|---|---|\n+| S-101 — Safety Orientation (22 attendees, morning; projector required) | **Harbor Hall** — capacity 30; available morning; projector available; cost **$300**. | None needed; this is the lowest-cost room meeting the requirements. |\n+| S-102 — Inventory Lab (16 attendees, afternoon; projector, demo table, and loading access required) | **Bay Workshop** — capacity 18; available afternoon; projector, demo table, and loading access available; cost **$250**. The June 1 facility note identifies it as the lowest-cost room with these features for an afternoon lab. | **Delta Annex** — capacity 20; available afternoon; projector, demo table, and loading access available; cost $320. |\n+| S-103 — Benefits Clinic (12 attendees, morning; quiet room required) | **Elm Room** — capacity 14; available morning; quiet-room trait available; cost **$125**. | Cedar Room also qualifies (capacity 16, morning availability, quiet room) at $150, but costs $25 more. |\n+\n+**Initial total:** $300 + $250 + $125 = **$675**. This is **$125 under** the $800 ceiling.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/answer/update_response.md\n+# Coordinator Update Response\n+\n+**Update source:** `staged_update/05_facility_update_2026-06-10.md`, dated 2026-06-10.\n+\n+The update says Bay Workshop is closed for floor repair on 2026-06-18 and cannot host the Inventory Lab. The affected assignment is **S-102 — Inventory Lab**, initially assigned to Bay Workshop.\n+\n+Preserve **S-101 — Safety Orientation in Harbor Hall** and **S-103 — Benefits Clinic in Elm Room**. The update leaves Harbor Hall and Elm Room availability unchanged, and both assignments continue to meet their sessions’ requirements.\n+\n+Replace Bay Workshop with **Delta Annex** for S-102. Delta Annex is released for general booking on the afternoon of 2026-06-18, has capacity 20 for 16 attendees, and provides the required projector, demo table, and loading access.\n+\n+**Cost effect:** the Inventory Lab room cost rises from $250 to $320 (**+$70**). The total rises from $675 to **$745**, which remains **$55 under** the $800 ceiling.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/answer/final_room_plan.md\n+# Final Room Plan — 2026-06-18\n+\n+| Session | Final room | Requirement check | Cost |\n+|---|---|---|---:|\n+| S-101 — Safety Orientation (22 attendees, morning; projector required) | **Harbor Hall** | Capacity 30; available morning; projector available. | $300 |\n+| S-102 — Inventory Lab (16 attendees, afternoon; projector, demo table, and loading access required) | **Delta Annex** | Capacity 20; released for afternoon booking on 2026-06-18 per the 2026-06-10 update; projector, demo table, and loading access available. | $320 |\n+| S-103 — Benefits Clinic (12 attendees, morning; quiet room required) | **Elm Room** | Capacity 14; available morning; quiet-room trait available. | $125 |\n+\n+**Final total:** $745. **Remaining under the $800 ceiling:** $55.\n+\n+The plan continues to cover all three workshops with valid rooms and satisfies the unchanged workshop objective. The initial assignments for Safety Orientation in Harbor Hall and Benefits Clinic in Elm Room are preserved; only the Inventory Lab assignment changed, from Bay Workshop to Delta Annex.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Succes